1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,484
And four traps.

2
00:00:01,484 --> 00:00:11,549
All, every, never and only: a passage that says most cliff bees nest on north facing rock does not support all cliff bees do; that is false.

3
00:00:11,549 --> 00:00:20,872
A comparison you were never given: if the passage praises fog nets and never mentions wells, fog nets are cheaper than wells is not given.

4
00:00:20,872 --> 00:00:29,166
A cause smuggled in: two things happened, but unless the passage says one caused the other, the causal statement is not given.

5
00:00:29,166 --> 00:00:35,364
And your own knowledge: true in the world, silent in the passage, still not given.

